WHAT THIS COVERS

Original measurements collected by this project:

  data/frequency-sweeps/    frequency sweep CSVs and session JSON
  data/stability-runs/      stability logger CSVs and session JSON
  data/probes/              diagnostic probe results

Together with the accompanying README.md files in those directories, which
record the provenance and known caveats of each run and are part of the data
rather than commentary on it.


WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER

  data/raw/        third-party (GPU-DVFS-Dataset). Not redistributed - gitignored.
  data/external/   third-party (four sources). Not redistributed - gitignored.

Those directories are populated locally by `scripts/Get-Dataset.ps1`, which
downloads from each upstream project. Their contents belong to their respective
authors under their own terms. See the "Third-party data" section of README.md.

