HOW TO CITE

  Raymond. Headroom: measured GPU frequency-efficiency data on consumer
  hardware. 2026. https://github.com/imaoofu/headroom

Please read the README.md in each data directory before using a run. Several
are explicitly marked not dataset-grade, and at least one carries a verdict
that was later shown to be wrong. Those notes exist so the data is not used
for more than it can support.
